From 25b220b34bd07e9814591749ed67cc4fb63b174f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sn3ro <zak.darek@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:57:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(ui): the tool drawing caches key on their theme inks

The tool list thumbnails and the holder outline keep their built shapes,
and those shapes carry theme colours. A theme change kept the old
colours. Each cache key now holds the inks its shapes carry.

Pinned by a_theme_change_of_the_inks_builds_the_row_drawing_again and
a_theme_change_of_the_inks_builds_the_holder_outline_again.

Refs #1120

